# Front-end dependencies. The BUILD OUTPUT in drishti/static/ is deliberately
# tracked: this is a local scientific tool with no CI, so `python drishti/app.py`
# has to work straight after a clone, without needing Node installed at all.
drishti/frontend/node_modules/
